Day 02 — Temporary User Setup

Completed my second hands-on task as part of the 100 Days of DevOps journey on KodeKloud.

Objective
Create a lowercase Linux user named john on App Server 1 with an account expiry date of 2026-12-07.

Command Executed

sudo useradd -e 2026-12-07 john

Verification

sudo chage -l john

Key Learnings

    Linux user management
    User creation using useradd
    Setting account expiry dates
    Verifying account expiration using chage
    Remote server administration using SSH
    Privilege escalation using sudo

